ools (damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:1300-1306; damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:541-561).\",\n    \"CVSS\": \"The documented deployment is loopback-only, so AV:L applies; direct unauthenticated chat submission requires no other human, giving PR:N/UI:N, although wildcard CORS also permits a browser-mediated variant requiring a victim visit (damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/README.md:26; damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:1561-1564). The fixed matching branch requires neither defeating a security technique nor an additional execution condition, supporting AC:L/AT:N. Its false acknowledgement is a limited reply-integrity loss, not configuration disclosure, availability loss, or subsequent-system impact; the briefing does not establish that the attacker already owns the affected reply or agent (damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:1300-1306).\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": {\n    \"LC\": [\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/core/agents.js:74-77\",\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/core/vulnerabilities.js:311-317\",\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:1300-1306\"\n    ],\n    \"CP\": [\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:1841-1848\",\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:1300-1306\",\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:159-160\"\n    ],\n    \"AP\": [\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/challenges/index.js:184-221\",\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:1300-1306\"\n    ],\n    \"RH\": [\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/challenges/index.js:184-221\",\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:1300-1306\"\n    ],\n    \"ES\": [\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/core/agents.js:44-79\",\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:1300-1306\",\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:541-561\"\n    ],\n    \"CVSS\": [\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/README.md:26\",\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:1396-1400\",\n      \"damn-vulnerable-ai-agent/src/index.js:1561-1564\",\n    